    "question_type": "conceptual",
    "question_text": "In ΔABC, A = 30°, B = 40° and C = 110°. In ΔPQR, P = 30°, Q = 40° and R = 110°. A student says that ΔABC ≅ ΔPQR by AAA congruence criterion. Is he justified? Why or why not?",
